Kronos Workbench
================

This project is a data / visualization / evaluation workbench built around the
Kronos K-line foundation model.

Upstream
--------

Kronos
  https://github.com/shiyu-coder/Kronos
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 ShiYu

This repository does not vendor the upstream model code or weights. Users
install them separately and point `KRONOS_UPSTREAM` / `KRONOS_MODEL_DIR` at
their checkout.

Third-party libraries
---------------------

pandas, numpy, matplotlib — BSD-3-Clause style licenses.
akshare — MIT (optional, for data fetching).
tushare — Apache-2.0 (optional, for data fetching).
torch, einops, huggingface_hub, safetensors — BSD/Apache/MIT (optional, for
inference).

Data
----

`examples/data/*.csv` contains trimmed historical OHLCV bars used only for
layout demos and tests. Market data is provided by public sources and is not
redistributed in full. No personal or account data is included.

